<title>USA: Genelabs promotes Smith to COO.</title>
<headline>Genelabs promotes Smith to COO.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genelabs Technologies Inc said it promoted James A.D. Smith to chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He previously served as vice president, marketing and business development.</p>
<p>Smith joined Genelabs in January 1994 as director of marketing and was appointed vice president, marketing and business development in June 1995.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Genelabs, he held several marketing and business development positions with ICN Pharmaceuticals, most recently as director of Worldwide Business Development.</p>
